ed"},{"original":"Chest","string":"Coffre","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"0002069A|Skyrim.esm","type":"CONT FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"TreasDwarvenChestLarge"},{"original":"Explodes for <10> points of frost damage to Health and Stamina.","string":"Explose en infligeant <10> points de dégâts de glace à la santé et à la vigueur.","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"0200F1BB|Dawnguard.esm","type":"AMMO DESC","index":null,"editor_id":"DLC1BoltSteelExplodingIce"},{"original":"All marksman's crossbows are powerful weapons which ignore 50% of an opponent's armor rating.","string":"Les arbalètes améliorées de la Garde de l'aube sont de puissantes armes qui ignorent 50 % de la valeur d'armure de l'adversaire.","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"05002E7A|Unofficial Skyrim Special Edition Patch.esp","type":"LSCR DESC","index":null,"editor_id":"UDGPDawnguardCrossbow"},{"original":"Chest","string":"Coffre","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"000B2035|Skyrim.esm","type":"CONT FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MerchantSolitudeFletcher"},{"original":"Dwarven Bolt of Ice","string":"Carreau dwemer de givre","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"0200F1B6|Dawnguard.esm","type":"PROJ FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"DLC1BoltDwarvenProjectileExplodingIce"},{"original":"Steel Bolt","string":"Carreau en acier","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"02000BB4|Dawnguard.esm","type":"PROJ FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"DLC1BoltSteelProjectile"},{"original":"<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\">\r\nSome of our more adventurous members have been searching for ways to improve our vampire-slaying capabilities. They came across some interesting Dwemer diagrams, and brought them to me. I can use the schematics to create new bolts for our crossbows. Cleaver dwarves.\r\n\r\nWhile you are out in the field, keep an eye out for the required components and I'm sure even you could create these new bolts.\r\n\r\n- Sorine\r\n</font>\r\n\r\n[pagebreak]\r\n\r\nThe following pages are full of sketches and notes on crafting explosive steel bolts.","string":"<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\">\nCertains de nos membres les plus aventureux ont cherché des moyens d'améliorer nos capacités à tuer des vampires. Ils sont tombés sur des diagrammes Dwemer intéressants et me les ont apportés. Je peux utiliser les schémas pour créer de nouveaux boulons pour nos arbalètes. Des nains à lames tranchantes.\n\nPendant que vous êtes sur le terrain, surveillez les composants nécessaires et je suis sûr que vous pourrez créer ces nouveaux boulons.\n\n- Sorine\n</font>\n\n[pagebreak]\n\nLes pages suivantes sont remplies de croquis et de notes sur la fabrication de boulons d'acier explosifs.","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"0600082F|Crossbow Integration.esp","type":"BOOK DESC","index":null,"editor_id":"VanikNotebook_CI"},{"original":"Steel Bolt of Ice","string":"Carreau en acier de givre","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"02010D8E|Dawnguard.esm","type":"PROJ FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"DLC1BoltSteelProjectileIce"},{"original":"Steel Marksman's Crossbow","string":"Arbalète en acier améliorée","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"06000808|Crossbow Integration.esp","type":"WEAP FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"DLC1SteelCrossbowEnhanced"},{"original":"Tilde","string":"Tilde","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"02010DE5|Dawnguard.esm","type":"NPC_ FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"DLC1DawnguardExterior01"},{"original":"Beleval","string":"Beleval","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"0201541C|Dawnguard.esm","type":"NPC_ FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"DLC1Beleval"},{"original":"Steel Bolt of Shock","string":"Carreau en acier de foudre","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"02010D8F|Dawnguard.esm","type":"PROJ FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"DLC1BoltSteelProjectileShock"},{"original":"Crossbows fire a deadly first shot. However, they are slow to reload.","string":"Les arbalètes utilisées par la Garde de l'aube lancent un projectile